titre$ Key to the species of Laccaria- Gro Gulden
com$ Gro Gulden A preliminary guide to the macromycetes in the Finse area / GF 2011
1,0 $ Basidia 2-spored $ L. pumila
1,2 $ Basidia 4-spored
2,3 $ Bluish-lilac shades present in lamellae and/or basal tomentum of stipe
2,4 $ Bluish-lilac shades absent
3,0 $ Pileus pinkish brown to brick-red, basal tomentum and generally also lamellae with a bluish-lilac shade $ L. bicolor
3,0 $ Pileus dark purplish brown, no bluish at stipe base, lamellae with ± bluish-lilac shade $ L. purpureobadia
4,5 $ Spores broadly ellipsoid to subglobose
4,0 $ Spores (sub)globose, < 10 µm long $ L. laccata var. pallidifolia
5,0 $ Most spores < 10 µm long, finely echinulate $ L. proxima
5,0 $ Most spores  > 10 µm long, with fairly long spines $ L. montana
